  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 1.0.4\n        - Limit generated template output to the four Clean Architecture projects\n        - Exclude repository, package, and build artifacts from generated projects\n\n        ## 1.0.3\n        - Add .NET 10 LTS support (default target framework)\n        - Update NuGet package versions for all supported frameworks\n\n        ## 1.0.1\n        - Add dedicated README for NuGet package page (README.nuget.md)\n\n        ## 1.0.0\n        - Initial release of the Clean Architecture (clean-onion) dotnet new template\n        - Four-layer solution: Core, Application, Infrastructure, Api\n        - DI extensions in each layer\n        - ASP.NET Core Web API with OpenAPI support",
